ement of going all the way around Kjerag.","abilities":["Takes extra damage on colliding with high ground"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":300,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"penumbral_snowball":{"slug":"penumbral_snowball","name":"Penumbral Snowball","icon":"/enemies-icons/Penumbral Snowball.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Creatures indigenous to Kjerag. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan seems to have changed their friendly nature, and made their fur even softer and fluffier, providing excellent protection against the cold.","abilities":["Absorbs passing Snowbrats to increase its weight, HP, ATK, DEF, and RES","Returns to initial form on colliding with high ground"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":300,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"rime_frostdillo":{"slug":"rime_frostdillo","name":"Rime Frostdillo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rime Frostdillo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Creatures with heavy spiked shells on their backs. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan has made them aggressive and agile. They can perform flips, turns, 180-degree about-faces, and triple rolls.","abilities":["Loses all DEF and RES and becomes unable to move for some time on colliding with high ground"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":700,"def":3200,"res":80,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"icefield_arts_guard":{"slug":"icefield_arts_guard","name":"Icefield Arts Guard","icon":"/enemies-icons/Icefield Arts Guard.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A special warrior born in a harsh environment. As they gain insight into their Arts, they become more skilled at utilizing every last bit of their power. They are extremely dangerous when they fall in battle.","abilities":["When defeated, deals Arts damage to all surrounding units and inflicts Cold","Loses HP when shifted"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":800,"def":350,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"bright_snowcap":{"slug":"bright_snowcap","name":"Bright Snowcap","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bright Snowcap.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Massive, umbrella-shaped mushrooms. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan makes their colors brighter and their texture more appealing, but Kjeragandr taught us to never eat colorful mushrooms.","abilities":["Cannot be shifted","[Takes Root] at specific locations, causing its tile to become undeployable","[Takes Root] Reduces damage taken and protects all units behind it from avalanches"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":800,"def":800,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"blackhorn_rhuul":{"slug":"blackhorn_rhuul","name":"Blackhorn Rhuul","icon":"/enemies-icons/Blackhorn Rhuul.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Sturdy burdenbeasts with massive horns on their heads. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan has turned their horns black. The Saintess said: Once upon a time, there was a girl who, finding the sight of others accompanied by their pets endearing, wanted a pet of her